      "properties": {},
      "title": "Read me first",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 08 · Quality — Sol-Attn\n\n**20 steps, no distillation**, with Sol-Attn instead of SageAttention. Both\nmodel branches are patched, so REF2VA clips are accelerated too.\n\n**Needs:** [ComfyUI-SolAttn_triton](https://github.com/DrBearJew/ComfyUI-SolAttn_triton)\n(and Triton). Sol-Attn is a training-free sparse attention kernel; on cards\nolder than Hopper leave `use_tma` off. Expect a modest gain over SageAttention.\n\nThis is a mode to *listen* to: the 4-step modes (09/10) are for judging the\npicture and the cut.\n\n**The demo board** is two 4 s clips: a car rolling right, then a clip that\ncontinues it, carrying 22 frames of motion and a second of sound across the\ncut. Press **Run** and watch the join at **4.46 s**.\n\n| | SageAttention | Sol-Attn |\n|---|---|---|\n| **20 steps** (full quality) | 07 | 08 |\n| **4 steps** (Turbo LoRA) | 09 | 10 |\n| **20 steps + Spectrum** | 12 | — |"
      ]
    },
