      "title": "Models",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Models for this workflow\n\nDownload each file into the folder named above it, inside `ComfyUI/models/` (ComfyUI Desktop: its shared `models` folder). If a file is missing when the workflow opens, ComfyUI offers to download it for you.\n\n**models/diffusion_models/**\n\n- [minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) — 21 GB\n  base checkpoint → `model` (T2VA, I2VA, FL2VA, L2VA)\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) — 21 GB\n  ref2va checkpoint → `ref_model` (REF2VA)\n\n**models/text_encoders/**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors) — 15.7 GB\n  text encoder → `clip`\n\n**models/vae/**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors) — 5.2 GB\n  video VAE → `vae`\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors) — 0.6 GB\n  audio VAE → `audio_vae`\n\n**Less memory?** All from [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3): `…_pruned_w6a8` checkpoints (16 GB each) instead of `int8_convrot`, and `minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot` (2.8 GB) instead of the fp16 video VAE. Pick them in the loaders after downloading.\n\n**Also used by the console (optional):**\n\n- *Prompt writer* — a GGUF model and llama.cpp's `llama-server` in `models/llama.cpp/` — see the extension's README.\n- *Reference editor* — SAM 3 from [facebook/sam3](https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam3) (gated: request access first) into `models/sam3/`."
      ],
